# Go Base Template — `graphql`

GraphQL-only branch. Fiber hosts `/graphql` + GraphiQL. Storage is
**in-memory**. No GORM / Postgres / Redis / REST / OpenAPI / Docker deps.

REST + GORM: checkout `main`.

## Yasaklar

- GORM / Postgres / Redis / migrations / Fluent maps yok
- REST controllers / OpenAPI / `src/docs` yok
- Repository / UoW / Outbox / `cmd/` / `internal/` / `platform/` / `features/` yok
- RabbitMQ / domain events / outbound HTTP yok
- `"Get"` öneki yok (`Todos`, `TodoById`)
- Servis `*apperr.Error` döner; resolver onu `error` olarak iletir
- Hata kodları `constants/` altında
- Resolver iş kuralı yazmaz — `services/` kullanır

## Dizin

```text
src/main.go
src/config/
src/extensions/graphql.go
src/common/{apperr,logger}/
src/constants/
src/graphql/
src/services/{resource}/   # service (in-memory) + validations/
src/models/{requests,responses}/
```

İsimlendirme: [STRUCTURE.md](../STRUCTURE.md).

## Prensipler

- Tek API: `/graphql`. Health: `/health` (main içinde).
- In-memory store; restart = data loss (template).
- Validation: service girişinde `validations/`.
